:"陆游","text":"渔翁持鱼叩舷卖，炯炯绿瞳双脸丹。\n我欲从之逝已远，菱歌一曲暮江寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6086,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔翁二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"船入芦花日暮时，双瞳炯炯鬓如丝。\n世间岂少磻溪叟，老向烟波人不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6087,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔翁二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"文叔君房两故人，可怜俱作白头新。\n桐江归伴邻翁醉，一笑相看意却真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6088,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔歌","author":"陆游","text":"斜阳收尽暮烟青，袅袅渔歌起远汀。\n商略野人何所恨，数声哀绝不堪听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6089,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甜羹","author":"陆游","text":"山厨薪桂软炊粳，旋洗香蔬手自烹。\n从此八珍俱避舍，天苏陁味属甜羹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6090,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甜羹之法以菘菜山药芋莱菔杂为之不施醯酱山庖珍烹也戏作一绝","author":"陆游","text":"老住湖边一把茆，时沽村酒具山殽。\n年来传得甜羹法，更为吴酸作解嘲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6091,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"移花遇小雨喜甚为赋二十字","author":"陆游","text":"独坐闲无事，烧香赋小诗。\n可怜清夜雨，及此种花时。","collection":"宋"